p08 : US Blanks 5'9"P (2010 catalog vector extraction; target 34.8 L)
p97 : This is an ideal “Grom” blank with medium volume. It has an excellent natural rocker which will also work very well in the 6’0P and 6’2P matched from the nose. A perfect hand shape blank that can also be used on the machine.
